## Choose uniformly by position, preserving managed identity and readonly child authority.
## @param items Growable source list; fixed callers use an explicit slice.
## @return Selected element; empty input raises checked failure and singleton skips entropy.
func choose<t>(const items: [t]) -> t:
    var index = convert.unwrap(_collection_index(items.count))
    return items[index]

## Recoverably choose by position without equality/hash/display constraints.
